    37	- Fidelity: the exported check file validates against `schema/verification.schema.json` and
    38	  `osd status` shows L4 for F3 after `osd verify --fidelity-from <file>`.
    39	- Mutation: removing `statement` from the manifest makes the rights-basis test fail.
